  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SWIFT 6</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SWIFT 6 programs will be the primary mechanism through which USAID/Office of Transition Initiatives (OTI) implements programming for the next ten years. Under this US$5 billion IDIQ, OTI will support U.S. foreign policy objectives by helping local partners advance peace and stability in fragile environments through a fast, flexible, and adaptable model that addresses key political transition and stabilization needs.</narrative>
  </description>
